{
  "_comment": [
    "DDP (Delivered Duty Paid) lookup table.",
    "Used by customs_rules.ddp_status_for_country_and_brand() to decide how",
    "response_generator.py answers UPS requests where the carrier reports",
    "that the customer refused the package and/or did not pay the extra/",
    "outstanding charges.",
    "Lookup key: (country_code, brand).",
    "  country_code: ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 destination country code for the",
    "    shipment under analysis (GET_FULL_ORDER shippingAddress.country,",
    "    stored in the pipeline as full_order_country_code).",
    "  brand: first 2 characters of shipment_order_number, e.g.",
    "    DG-USC11593083 -> DG.",
    "Value: ddp=true  -> shipment is Delivered Duty Paid. Reply asks the",
    "         carrier to proceed with delivery and debit the remaining",
    "         costs to the TLG UPS account.",
    "       ddp=false -> shipment is NOT Delivered Duty Paid. Reply",
    "         confirms the return and asks the carrier to debit all",
    "         relative costs to the TLG UPS account.",
    "If a (country_code, brand) pair is not present in \"rows\" below, the",
    "DDP status cannot be determined and the ticket is routed to human",
    "review instead of being answered automatically."
  ],
  "_row_schema": [
    "country_code",
    "brand",
    "ddp"
  ],
